        <h1 class="k-legal__title">About Kaarigar</h1>
        <p class="k-legal__updated">Building the Workforce Infrastructure for India's Businesses</p>

        <p>
            Every day, millions of businesses across India struggle with one common
            challenge — finding the right people at the right time.
        </p>
        <p>
            A restaurant loses customers because two stewards don't report for work.
            A warehouse misses dispatch deadlines due to labour shortages. A manufacturing
            unit slows production because of absenteeism. A retail store struggles during
            festive rush. A hotel cannot maintain service standards during peak occupancy.
            A hospital urgently needs support staff. An event organizer requires hundreds
            of workers overnight.
        </p>
        <p>
            While businesses move faster than ever, workforce hiring still depends on
            phone calls, local contractors, WhatsApp groups and last-minute arrangements.
        </p>
        <p>We believe businesses deserve a better way to hire.</p>
        <p>
            Kaarigar is building India's on-demand workforce infrastructure — a technology
            platform that enables businesses to access verified workers whenever they need
            them, whether for a few hours, a single shift, a project, seasonal demand or
            long-term staffing.
        </p>
        <p>
            We are transforming workforce hiring from an uncertain, time-consuming process
            into a fast, transparent and reliable digital experience.
        </p>
        <p>
            Just as businesses can instantly book transportation, payments or cloud
            services, we envision a future where they can instantly access trusted
            workforce through Kaarigar.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Vision</h2>
        <p>To become the workforce infrastructure that powers every business in India.</p>
        <p>
            We envision a future where no restaurant delays service because of staff
            shortages, no warehouse misses deliveries due to lack of manpower, no
            manufacturer loses production because of absenteeism, and no skilled worker
            remains unemployed because opportunities are difficult to find.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our vision is to build India's most trusted, technology-driven workforce
            marketplace — connecting millions of businesses with millions of skilled
            workers through one intelligent platform.
        </p>
        <p>
            As India's economy grows, Kaarigar aims to become the operating layer that
            keeps businesses running by ensuring reliable access to workforce whenever and
            wherever it is needed.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>To make workforce hiring as simple as ordering a cab or food.</p>
        <p>
            We are on a mission to eliminate the inefficiencies of traditional hiring by
            enabling businesses to discover, hire and manage verified workers in minutes
            instead of days.
        </p>
        <p>
            At the same time, we are committed to creating better opportunities for
            India's skilled and semi-skilled workforce by providing greater visibility,
            fair access to work, flexible earning options and a digital professional
            identity.
        </p>
        <p>
            Through technology, verification, transparency and trust, we are building a
            workforce ecosystem where businesses grow faster and workers build sustainable
            livelihoods.
        </p>

        <h2>Why Kaarigar Exists</h2>
        <p>
            Businesses don't fail because they lack customers alone. They often struggle
            because they cannot find dependable people when they need them most.
        </p>
        <p>
            Workers don't remain unemployed because they lack skills alone. Many lack
            visibility, access and timely opportunities.
        </p>
        <p>Kaarigar exists to bridge this gap.</p>
        <p>
            We are creating a platform where workforce demand and workforce supply meet in
            real time — reducing hiring delays, improving productivity and creating
            economic opportunities at scale.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Purpose</h2>
        <p>
            We believe that every successful shift strengthens a business, supports a
            family and contributes to India's economic growth.
        </p>
        <p>Every worker who finds work through Kaarigar earns with dignity.</p>
        <p>Every employer who fills an urgent shift keeps operations running.</p>
        <p>Every successful match creates value for both sides.</p>
        <p>That is the future we are building.</p>

        <h2>Our Core Principles</h2>

        <h3>Trust First</h3>
        <p>
            Every relationship begins with trust. We strive to build confidence through
            verification, transparency and accountability.
        </p>

        <h3>Speed Matters</h3>
        <p>
            Businesses shouldn't have to wait days to solve workforce shortages. We focus
            on helping employers find workers quickly and efficiently.
        </p>

        <h3>Opportunity for Everyone</h3>
        <p>
            Every skilled worker deserves fair access to earning opportunities, regardless
            of background.
        </p>

        <h3>Technology with Purpose</h3>
        <p>
            We use technology to solve practical workforce challenges — not to add
            complexity.
        </p>

        <h3>Long-Term Partnerships</h3>
        <p>
            Our success is measured by the lasting relationships we help create between
            businesses and workers.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Ambition</h2>
        <p>We are not building another job portal.</p>
        <p>We are building the digital workforce infrastructure for India's businesses.</p>
        <p>
            From neighbourhood restaurants to national retail chains, from warehouses to
            manufacturing plants, from hospitals to logistics providers, Kaarigar aims to
            become the trusted platform businesses rely on whenever they need workforce.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our ambition is to help shape the future of work in India — making workforce
            hiring faster, more reliable and more accessible for every business, while
            creating meaningful opportunities for millions of workers.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

